---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PulseLine from '../components/PulseLine.astro';

import graph from '../../public/data/graph.json';
import hospitalFile from '../../public/data/hospitals.json';

const nodeCount = graph.meta.nodeCount.toLocaleString();
const edgeCount = graph.meta.edgeCount.toLocaleString();
const hospitalCount = hospitalFile.meta.hospitalCount;
---

<Layout title="Pulse — disaster control-room decision support">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
    <!-- Hero: the one orchestrated moment (section 14). -->
    <section class="flex min-h-[80vh] flex-col justify-center py-20">
      <PulseLine class="mb-10 h-14 w-full max-w-md" />

      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl leading-[1.05] font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-7xl">
        <span class="ice-text">Pulse</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-[62ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-mist sm:text-xl">
        A control-room tool that stops mass-casualty patients all going to the nearest
        hospital, shows its reasoning, and keeps a record nobody can quietly edit.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <a
          class="rounded-lg bg-ice-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-matte transition-colors hover:bg-ice-500"
          href="/console">Open the console</a
        >
        <a
          class="rounded-lg border border-hairline px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-frost transition-colors hover:border-ice-500"
          href="/about">How it works</a
        >
      </div>

      <dl class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap gap-x-10 gap-y-4 text-sm">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-mist">Real road segments</dt>
          <dd class="tabular font-display text-xl text-frost">{edgeCount}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-mist">Junctions</dt>
          <dd class="tabular font-display text-xl text-frost">{nodeCount}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-mist">Hospitals mapped</dt>
          <dd class="tabular font-display text-xl text-frost">{hospitalCount}</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <!-- What the demo shows. -->
    <section class="border-t border-hairline py-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">What you will see</h2>
      <ol class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li class="rounded-xl bg-slate p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ice-300">1. A crowd crush at Parel</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">
            Casualties appear in three waves and are triaged with the standard START
            colours. Fourteen ambulances is deliberately too few.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-xl bg-slate p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ice-300">2. The plan re-forms every minute</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">
            Around minute 12 a main approach road closes. Around minute 20 the nearest
            large hospital runs out of beds. Watch the assignments change.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-xl bg-slate p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ice-300">3. Every decision explains itself</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">
            Open any decision to see the travel times, the hospital load penalty, the
            severity weight, and which alternatives were rejected and why.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-xl bg-slate p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ice-300">4. The record resists editing</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">
            Pin a checkpoint, then use the demo tools to tamper with the log. Verification
            names the first row that no longer adds up.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- What is real and what is simulated (section 13). -->
    <section class="border-t border-hairline py-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">What is real and what is simulated</h2>
      <dl class="mt-6 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate p-5">
          <dt class="text-sm font-medium text-ice-300">Real</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">
            The street network and hospital locations of South Mumbai's eastern spine,
            extracted from OpenStreetMap. Routing runs on that real graph, so a closed
            road changes real travel times.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate p-5">
          <dt class="text-sm font-medium text-ice-300">Simulated</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">
            Casualties, ambulances, bed counts, supplies and every timing parameter.
            Nothing here is a live feed. Each assumption is listed on the About page.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
